$$ Atmospheric loading displacements
$$
$$ Amplitudes of site displacements (in mm) are given
$$ in VEN (Vertical-East-North) system
$$ Row order:
$$            Vertical
$$            East     (from West to East)
$$            North    (from South to North)
$$
$$ COLUMN ORDER: A_1  B_1  A_2  B_2  A_3  B_3  b_0  b_1  Sigma
$$ METHOD:
$$ Total displacement is Sum of three harmonic terms (annual,
$$ semiannual and diurnal)
$$ Sum[A_i*Cos(omega_i*t)+Sin(omega_i*t)]
$$
$$ where t = MJD_obs - 45700.0,  MJD_obs is Modified JD of obsrvation (1984,1,1),
$$ omega_1 = 2Pi / 365.2422
$$ omega_2 = 2Pi / 182.12
$$ omega_3 = 2Pi / 1.0
$$
$$ and regression with local pressure variations Delta P = P(MJD_obs) - P_mean:
$$ b_0 + b_1*Delta P
$$
$$ P.S. Sigma is variance of model
$$ END HEADER
